  "title": "Simple Crème Brûlée Dessert",
  "description": "This easy crème brûlée recipe features a smooth, pudding-like custard with a crunchy, torched sugar topping for a decadent special occasion dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "sous-chef-jason"
